OL,3,GNEWSAWas this Coventry man's death
OL,4,Asentence based on flawed evidence?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas Burbury was a 21-year-old silk
OL,7,Fweaver living in Coventry with his
OL,8,Fparents when he was convicted of
OL,9,Fleading a mob that burned down a mill
OL,10,Fin the city.
OL,12,FSentenced to death, a campaign saved
OL,13,Fhis life and the sentence commuted to
OL,14,Fdeportation instead to Australia.
OL,16,FAlmost 200 years later, one of his
OL,17,Fdescendants, Brisbane-based
OL,18,Flawyer-turned-author Sarah Thornton,
OL,19,Fclaims the evidence used to convict him
OL,20,Fis likely to have been questionable at
OL,21,Fbest.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
